===Verb===
{{sah-verb}}

# {{lb|sah|intransitive}} ({{n-g|with [[dative case|dat.]]}}) to [[go]] ({{n-g|somewhere}})
#: {{syn|sah|сырыт}}
# ({{n-g|with [[ablative case|abl.]]}}) to [[go away]], to [[leave]], to [[depart]]
#: {{syn|sah|таҕыс}}
#: {{ant|sah|киир|t1=to enter|хаал|t2=to stay}}
# to go ({{n-g|well, badly, etc.}})
#: {{uxi|sah|[[үлэ]] [[үчүгэй]]дик '''барар'''|work '''is going''' well}}
# {{lb|sah|euphemism}} to go, to [[die]] {{top|sah|Death}}
# ({{n-g|as an auxiliary verb, following the -ан form of another verb}})<br />to [[start]] something, to go and do something
#: {{uxi|sah|[[үлэлээ]]н '''бар'''|'''to start''' working}}
#: {{uxi|sah|[[аах|ааҕан]] '''бар'''|'''to start''' reading}}
# ({{n-g|as '''баран''', following the -ан form of another verb, and itself followed by another clause}})<br />({{n-g|by extension from the above sense}})<br />[[after]]
#: {{syndiff|sah|хойут}}
#: {{uxi|sah|[[эт]]эн '''баран''', [[өйдөө]]түм|'''after''' I said it, I understood}}

Notice the range of senses (compare {{m+|en|go}}).

